      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BACKYARD FRIENDS (4) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (17.79) in a Grade 5 at Richmond Straight. Tough to beat if on-song. AUDREY'S MAGIC (5) hit the ground running from a squeeze draw and prominent early but run ended and faded to finish 6th at this track in Grade 5 company. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from eight starts. Deserves plenty of respect. NAN SAID NO (1) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (22.91) at this track last time. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. A big run wouldn't surprise. NOT CLIFFORD (2) is right in the mix.",
